WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is something
we have in common.

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:04.604
At what age -- he's 14 now --
at what age did he comprehend

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
what it was you
that did for a living?

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:08.508 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-I don't know exactly.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.477 line:92%
But I'll give you an example --

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:15.515
two examples that I think
illustrate perhaps nothing.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.082 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.518
You know when you're driving in
New York City,

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, coming down
the West Side Highway,

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:24.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
and there is only two ways in
and two ways out

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:24.657 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
of New York City.

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:27.293
And you hear
one of these crazy motorcycles.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:30.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
It just...
[ Imitates motorcycle ]

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:32.165 size:84% position:42% line:92%
And traffic is stalled.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.400 line:92%
But you see a guy coming.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he's weaving in and out
of traffic.

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:38.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
If he's going 100,
he's going 120.

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:42.108
So we're stuck in traffic,
and here comes this guy.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:42.609 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And on his back,

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:47.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
he has a big, like,
semi-metallic instrument case,

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
one of those great big things

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
you put
a stringed instrument in.

00:00:51.785 --> 00:00:54.721 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he is going 120
with this thing on his back.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.757 size:75% position:38%
And my son screamed,
"Get out of my way!

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.393 line:92%
I'm late for the cello lesson!"

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.961 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:04.297 line:92%
I thought that was pretty good.

00:01:04.297 --> 00:01:05.331 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-That's really good.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:09.302
-So now we're farther down the
road and we're stuck in traffic.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.003 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And it's hot as hell.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:12.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I roll down the window
and Harry says to me,

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:13.973 line:92%
"Dad, roll up the window."

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.676 size:88% position:44%
And I said, "Harry, it's
screaming hot in here.

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why do I have to
roll up the window?"

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:22.549 size:88% position:44%
And my son says to me,
"Someone might see you."

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.717 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:25.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, there you go.

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
So does that answer
your question?

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.755 line:92%
Yeah, I felt pretty good.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:31.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's really --
-Yeah, that's right.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:34.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]
-How does --

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:41.434
Does your son -- Does your son
have an opinion on the beard?

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.869 line:92%
-You know, that's interesting.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:44.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
I forget that
I have the damn beard.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:45.405 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:51.511
And I'm surprised that no one
has said to me, "Hey, dumbass."

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.946 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.946 --> 00:01:56.850
I was up skiing in the Catskills
one day last winter.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:02.789
And driving out, there is a ski
store that says goggles sale.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:06.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so I stopped
and I thought, "Whoa!"

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:06.993 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:10.597
-You know, if you don't stop for
a goggle sale,

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:13.199 line:92%
there is not much left in you.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:13.833 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:16.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I go in,
and I see a guy in there.

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:20.073
And I said, "I guess
this is your busy time of year."

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:24.277
And he says, "Why?"
And I said, "Well, goggle sale."

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:25.245 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:27.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he said,
"What can I do for you?"

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:28.548 size:84% position:42% line:92%
He was not in any mood.

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:32.218
And I said, "I'm here to buy
a pair of pants for my son."

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.754 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said,
"Oh, they're all over there.

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:36.022 line:92%
So I find a pair of pants.

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:37.991 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he says,
"Okay, is your son here?"

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:43.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just looked around and I
said, "No, he's not here."

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.231 line:92%
I said, "Stay in the car.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:47.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm going in there
to buy you pants."

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:48.501 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:51.104
I said -- He said, "Well, you
know, there is no refunds."

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:54.274
The guy says to me, and I said,
"Don't worry about it.

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:54.908 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
If they don't fit,

00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:57.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll just bring it right back
and get a refund."

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:59.479 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:02.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's not laughing at
any of this.

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:04.050 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, now I pay --
It's like 120 bucks.

00:03:06.653 --> 00:03:09.322
So, I got a wad of 20s and I
start counting out the 20s.

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:10.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
The guy --
I've never seen this before --

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:15.295
the guy picks up each 20, looks
at it and then makes a mark

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:18.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then picks it up and looks
at it and makes a mark.

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he gets about halfway
through,

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:23.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I said to him, "I'm sorry.
What are you doing?"

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.270 line:92%
He said, "I'm just doing my job.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:28.841 size:88% position:44%
I have to check and see
if they're counterfeit."

00:03:28.841 --> 00:03:29.542 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And I said, "Really?

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:33.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do I look like the kind of guy
that would come up here

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.782 align:start size:94% position:6%
and start passing
counterfeit --"

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:38.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then I realized,
"Oh, yeah, I do."

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:39.986 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.986 --> 00:03:41.421 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I forgot.

